refusal: a name outside the\\n// environment-name grammar, a literal colliding with an inherited name, or\\n// a NUL byte or invalid UTF-8 in a value.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3118,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 780,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
