[exit 1]\\nok: N-creation-literal: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the background caller at the creation choke point; the gate still refuses the capitalized twin. Kill path: background miss reports the creation code instead of the typed unavailable. [exit 1]\\nok: N-caller-vocabulary: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the operator caller past the vocabulary arm; every other unknown caller still refuses. Kill reroutes to the dependencies refusal. [exit 1]\\nok: N-details-remediation: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly remediation-less requests past the typed-details arm; generation- and broker-less still refuse. Kill reroutes to the dependencies refusal. [exit 1]\\nok: N-unattested-foreground: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly sentinel-passed-but-smoke-missing running servers to attach; every other unattested report still refuses. [exit 1]\\nok: N-spawn-swallow: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the fixture spawn failure as success; every other spawn failure still reports. [exit 1]\\nok: N-probe-swallow-foreground: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the fixture probe failure as an absent server (then spawns); every other probe failure still passes through. [exit 1]\\nok: N-probe-swallow-background: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the fixture probe failure as a broker miss (then reports unavailable); every other probe failure still passes through. [exit 1]\\nok: N-argv-socket: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the default path at the spawn-socket arm; every other ambient socket still refuses. [exit 1]\\nok: N-argv-session: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the PID-form session past our wiring of the landed UUIDv7 grammar; every other malformed session still refuses. [exit 1]\\nok: N-deps-background: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the nil-probe-with-spawn background request past the dependencies arm; the fully-nil request still refuses. Kill path: the admitted request panics on the nil probe, and the panic fails the test. [exit 1]\\nok: N-deps-foreground: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the half-nil foreground dependencies past the arm; fully-nil dependencies still refuse. Kill path: the admitted request panics on the nil spawn, and the panic fails the test. [exit 1]\\nok: D-background-fallback: KILLED (want KILLED) :: SUPPLEMENTARY ADDITIVE, not a narrowing: plants the reviewer-shaped direct-creation call on the background miss path. Kill path: every background-miss spy asserts zero spawn calls. [exit 1]\\nok: C-control: SURVIVED (want SURVIVED) :: Harmless control: a comment-only edit that must SURVIVE, proving the harness observes outcomes. [exit 0]\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 5607,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1402,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
